WEBVTT

00:02.939 --> 00:08.973
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:09.042 --> 00:10.870
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

00:10.939 --> 00:13.249
- Bonjour, art lovers.
- 你好，艺术爱好者。

00:13.318 --> 00:16.594
Tonight, for your
viewing enjoyment,
今晚，为你
观赏享受，

00:16.663 --> 00:20.939
we present a portrait
painted in shades of greed.
我们呈现一幅肖像
被描绘成贪婪的色调。

00:23.214 --> 00:25.008
- Ahh!
Another day,
- 啊！
又一天，

00:25.076 --> 00:27.076
another whole bunch of dollars!
又一大笔钱！

00:27.145 --> 00:28.663
[laughs]
[笑]

00:28.732 --> 00:30.249
[metallic clinking]
Hmm?
[金属叮当作响]
嗯？

00:30.318 --> 00:33.214
Ooh, a quarter!
哦，四分之一！

00:34.180 --> 00:36.456
Gimme, gimme, gimme, gimme.
给我，给我，给我，给我。

00:36.525 --> 00:38.042
Whew, come back here, you!
呼呼，你快回来吧！

00:38.111 --> 00:39.421
Hey, hey, where are you going?
嘿嘿嘿，你要去哪儿？

00:40.283 --> 00:42.249
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

00:42.318 --> 00:44.145
[exhales]
Whew.
[呼气]
呼。

00:44.214 --> 00:45.663
[sighs]
[叹气]

00:47.732 --> 00:49.076
Eh?
呃？

00:49.145 --> 00:51.594
Yah!
[blubbering]
啊！
[哭泣]

00:51.663 --> 00:52.870
[ding]
[叮]

00:54.973 --> 00:56.973
[struggling efforts]
【奋斗努力】

01:00.111 --> 01:01.594
Huh?
啊？

01:03.076 --> 01:05.904
Ooh, this quarter is
really making me work.
哦，这个季度是
真的让我工作。

01:09.663 --> 01:10.628
[clinks]
[叮当声]

01:10.697 --> 01:13.697
Huh?
Hey, get back here!
啊？
嘿，快回来吧！

01:15.283 --> 01:16.628
Ugh!
啊!

01:16.697 --> 01:18.456
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:19.904 --> 01:21.870
- Greetings, stranger.
- Ahh!
- 你好，陌生人。
- 啊！

01:21.939 --> 01:25.387
Welcome to my
Emporium of Wonders.
欢迎来到我的
奇迹商场。

01:25.456 --> 01:27.352
Can I interest you
in a traditional
我可以让你感兴趣吗
在传统的

01:27.421 --> 01:30.214
Klopnodian Spladunker?
克洛普诺德斯普拉德克？

01:30.283 --> 01:32.939
Or perhaps a lightly
used Flooner?
或者也许轻轻地
用过弗洛纳吗？

01:33.008 --> 01:34.352
- No thanks, old timer.
- 不，谢谢，老家伙。

01:34.421 --> 01:36.042
I just want me quarter.
我只想要四分之一。

01:36.111 --> 01:38.732
It seems to have hopped
into your pay phone here.
好像跳了
请输入您的付费电话。

01:38.801 --> 01:40.352
- Oh, I see.
- 我懂了。

01:40.421 --> 01:42.697
Well I have no power
to retrieve your coin,
好吧，我没有权力
取回你的硬币，

01:42.766 --> 01:45.008
but I can let you
have the payphone
但我可以让你
有公用电话

01:45.076 --> 01:48.145
for the low, low price of...
为了低廉的价格...

01:48.214 --> 01:49.352
free.
自由的。

01:49.421 --> 01:51.214
- Free?
I'll take it!
- 自由的？
我要买它！

01:51.283 --> 01:54.732
- But be warned, that
payphone comes with a curse.
- 但请注意，
公用电话带有诅咒。

01:54.801 --> 01:56.663
[thunder booms]
[woman screams]
[雷霆轰鸣]
[女人尖叫]

01:56.732 --> 01:58.870
- Really?
How much does the curse cost?
- 真的吗？
诅咒要花多少钱？

01:58.939 --> 02:01.283
- What?
No, the curse is free.
- 什么？
不，诅咒是免费的。

02:01.352 --> 02:02.490
It comes with the phone.
它随手机一起提供。

02:02.559 --> 02:03.904
- Well then!
- 那么！

02:03.973 --> 02:05.490
I'll take the curse, too!
我也来承受诅咒吧！

02:05.559 --> 02:08.180
[chuckling]
- Heed my Kapritzka!
[轻笑]
- 听我的卡普里兹卡！

02:08.249 --> 02:11.145
Beware the call of the porch!
当心门廊的呼唤！

02:11.214 --> 02:13.008
Beware!
提防！

02:13.076 --> 02:14.421
Ah, forget it.
啊，算了。

02:16.801 --> 02:18.352
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:18.421 --> 02:20.387
Listen up, happy Krustomers!
听着，快乐的 Krustomers！

02:20.456 --> 02:23.214
For the low price of
a quarter, now you, too,
对于低廉的价格
四分之一，现在你也是，

02:23.283 --> 02:24.801
can make that important call
可以拨打那个重要电话

02:24.870 --> 02:27.249
while you're eating
a Krabby Patty!
当你吃饭的时候
蟹肉饼！

02:27.318 --> 02:29.559
[ringing]
[铃声]

02:29.628 --> 02:31.766
Ahoy, there. Krusty Krab.
啊嘿，在那里。蟹堡王。

02:31.835 --> 02:34.042
Eugene Krabs,
proprietor, speaking.
尤金·克拉布斯，
楼主，说话了。

02:34.111 --> 02:35.283
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

02:35.352 --> 02:38.145
Give away your
Krabby Patties!
放弃你的
蟹肉饼！

02:38.214 --> 02:40.663
Give them all away!
把他们全都扔掉！

02:40.732 --> 02:44.042
- [gasps] What kind of obscene
phone call is this?
- [喘气] 什么样的淫秽
电话是这个吗？

02:44.111 --> 02:46.870
When I find out who you are,
I'm gonna--
当我知道你是谁时
我要--

02:46.939 --> 02:47.904
Oh!
哦！

02:47.973 --> 02:49.490
Hey!
嘿！

02:49.559 --> 02:52.111
[line trilling]
[行颤音]

02:52.180 --> 02:55.663
Must give patties away.
一定要送肉饼。

02:55.732 --> 02:56.697
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

02:56.766 --> 02:58.835
[all exclaim]
No money.
[所有人惊呼]
没有钱。

02:58.904 --> 03:01.076
Patties free!
馅饼免费！

03:01.145 --> 03:02.594
- Free patties?
- 免费肉饼？

03:02.663 --> 03:04.421
Oh, Mr. Krabs!
哦，蟹老板！

03:04.490 --> 03:07.145
You finally found
your inner generosity.
你终于找到了
你内心的慷慨。

03:07.214 --> 03:08.559
Hooray!
万岁！

03:09.835 --> 03:12.801
Krabby Patties for everyone!
蟹肉饼送给大家！

03:12.870 --> 03:14.490
Wha! Yow!
世界卫生大会！哟！

03:14.559 --> 03:16.732
The Krab is picking up the tab!
螃蟹要买单了！

03:16.801 --> 03:18.801
[all hooting and hollering]
[所有的叫喊声和叫喊声]

03:18.870 --> 03:21.214
- All free.
- 全部免费。

03:21.283 --> 03:23.456
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

03:23.525 --> 03:24.732
[all munching]
[全都在咀嚼]

03:24.801 --> 03:26.663
- [evil laughter]
- [邪恶的笑声]

03:30.387 --> 03:31.594
- [blubbering]
- [哭泣]

03:31.663 --> 03:33.835
Huh? What just happened?
啊？刚刚发生了什么？

03:35.697 --> 03:37.697
Oh, boy! A quarter!
哦，孩子！四分之一！

03:37.766 --> 03:39.352
I knew this thing
would pay off!
我知道这件事
会有回报的！

03:39.421 --> 03:40.594
- Patties here!
- [yelps]
- 这里有馅饼！
- [尖叫声]

03:40.663 --> 03:41.835
- Free patties!
- 免费肉饼！

03:41.904 --> 03:43.559
Get your patties
while they're hot!
拿你的肉饼
趁他们还热的时候！

03:43.628 --> 03:45.387
Get 'em while they're free!
趁他们有空的时候获取它们！

03:45.456 --> 03:47.490
- Free?
[woman screams]
- 自由的？
[女人尖叫]

03:47.559 --> 03:49.249
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:50.180 --> 03:53.180
SpongeBob! There's no free
lunches at the Krusty Krab!
海绵宝宝！没有免费的
在蟹堡王吃午餐！

03:53.249 --> 03:55.870
[all clamoring]
Have you gone insane?
[全都吵闹]
你疯了吗？

03:55.939 --> 03:57.594
Get back in the kitchen
and stitch
回到厨房
并缝合

03:57.663 --> 03:59.214
these patty halves
back together
这些半块肉饼
回到一起

03:59.283 --> 04:00.939
so we can sell 'em again.
这样我们就可以再次出售它们。

04:01.008 --> 04:02.042
[sign poofs]
[噗]

04:02.111 --> 04:05.008
- [groans]
It was too good to last.
- [呻吟]
它太好了，无法持久。

04:05.904 --> 04:07.490
[ringing]
[铃声]

04:07.559 --> 04:09.283
- Krusty Krab, Eugene--
[groans]
- 蟹堡王，尤金 -
[呻吟]

04:09.352 --> 04:13.145
- [evil laughter]
Now give away your money!
- [邪恶的笑声]
现在就把你的钱捐出去吧！

04:13.214 --> 04:15.352
Every last cent!
每一分钱！

04:15.421 --> 04:17.939
- Must give away money.
- 必须捐钱。

04:19.318 --> 04:21.352
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:21.421 --> 04:22.628
[whistle blares]
[汽笛声]

04:22.697 --> 04:24.939
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

04:26.490 --> 04:30.663
- Give away all money, Boy-O!
- 把所有的钱都捐出去，Boy-O！

04:30.732 --> 04:32.835
- But you just said that--
- 但你刚刚说过--

04:32.904 --> 04:35.904
Oh, I knew you were
only kidding, Mr. Krabs!
哦，我知道你是
开玩笑吧，蟹老板！

04:35.973 --> 04:39.387
You really are generous!
[chuckles]
你还真是大方啊！
[笑声]

04:39.456 --> 04:41.525
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

04:45.732 --> 04:47.628
[chuckles]
Another quarter!
[笑声]
又一个季度！

04:47.697 --> 04:49.490
I love this phone!
[cash register dings]
我喜欢这款手机！
[收银机叮叮声]

04:49.559 --> 04:52.697
[all clamoring]
- Whoo! [laughing]
[全都吵闹]
- 呼！ [笑]

04:52.766 --> 04:56.318
Whee!
[all cheering]
哎哟！
[大家欢呼]

04:56.387 --> 04:57.835
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:57.904 --> 05:00.249
What are you doing
with me money?
你在做什么
跟我有钱吗？

05:00.318 --> 05:02.387
- Well, I thought you
told me to, Mr. Krabs.
- 嗯，我以为你
蟹老板告诉我的。

05:02.456 --> 05:04.490
I--oh, I don't understand.
我——哦，我不明白。

05:04.559 --> 05:06.628
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

05:06.697 --> 05:08.904
- Uh! Ooh!
- And now, Krabs,
- 呃！哦！
- 现在，蟹蟹，

05:08.973 --> 05:11.628
give away the Krusty Krab!
赠送蟹堡王！

05:11.697 --> 05:14.076
[evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

05:14.145 --> 05:16.076
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:16.145 --> 05:18.628
Yes!
With this laser cannon,
是的！
有了这门激光炮，

05:18.697 --> 05:21.525
I can finally blast Krabs!
我终于可以炸螃蟹了！

05:21.594 --> 05:22.525
Huh?
啊？

05:22.594 --> 05:23.973
Homina-wha?
霍米纳-什么？

05:24.042 --> 05:27.042
- Here his deed to Krusty Krab.
- 这是他对蟹堡王的契约。

05:27.111 --> 05:28.870
She's all yours.
她就是你的了。

05:30.525 --> 05:32.870
- Something doesn't
seem right here.
- 有些东西没有
似乎就在这里。

05:32.939 --> 05:35.559
But like Granny Plankton
always says,
但就像浮游生物奶奶一样
总是说，

05:35.628 --> 05:38.111
never look a gift snail
under the shell!
永远不要看礼物蜗牛
在壳下！

05:38.180 --> 05:40.456
I win!
[laughs]
我赢了！
[笑]

05:40.525 --> 05:42.594
I'm the greatest!
我是最伟大的！

05:42.663 --> 05:43.939
Huh?
[clank]
啊？
[铮铮]

05:44.008 --> 05:45.008
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

05:47.318 --> 05:51.456
[hypnotic music]
[催眠音乐]

05:51.525 --> 05:54.214
- Ooh!
[laughs]
- 哦！
[笑]

05:54.283 --> 05:56.042
Huh?
啊？

05:56.111 --> 05:58.870
Ohh, what the--
where's me quarter?
哦，那是什么——
我在哪里？

05:58.939 --> 06:00.387
- [evil laughter]
- [grunting]
- [邪恶的笑声]
- [咕哝]

06:00.456 --> 06:03.939
- Perhaps generosity
is its own reward?
- 也许是慷慨
是它自己的奖励吗？

06:04.008 --> 06:05.559
- Never!
- [laughs]
- 绝不！
- [笑]

06:05.628 --> 06:07.214
- [grunts, laughs]
- [咕哝，大笑]

06:07.283 --> 06:09.008
Huh? Ooh.
啊？哦。

06:10.076 --> 06:11.145
- Uh--
- 呃--

06:12.904 --> 06:15.835
[both growling]
[双方咆哮]

06:17.732 --> 06:19.249
- Huh?
- 啊？

06:19.318 --> 06:20.352
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:20.421 --> 06:22.283
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:23.697 --> 06:25.180
- Hey, what's the big idea?
- 嘿，有什么好主意吗？

06:25.249 --> 06:27.628
And where is that quarter
you owe--
那四分之一在哪里
你欠——

06:27.697 --> 06:30.421
- I'm free!
Ha-ha!
- 我有空了！
哈哈！

06:30.490 --> 06:32.180
[muttering] Um--
[嘀咕] 嗯——

06:32.249 --> 06:34.835
Hey kid, lend me
a quarter for the bus?
嘿小子，借给我吧
乘公共汽车需要四分之一吗？

06:34.904 --> 06:37.525
- Sure thing, Mr. Demon!
- 当然可以，恶魔先生！

06:37.594 --> 06:39.594
- I'm finally free!
- 我终于自由了！

06:39.663 --> 06:42.145
[laughs]
[笑]

06:42.214 --> 06:44.318
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

06:44.387 --> 06:45.973
- Well, this ain't so bad.
- 嗯，这还不错。

06:46.042 --> 06:48.835
Steady work,
and plenty of quarters!
工作稳定，
还有充足的宿舍！

06:48.904 --> 06:51.559
[laughs]
A crab could get used to this!
[笑]
螃蟹可能会习惯这个！

06:51.628 --> 06:52.835
[crashing]
Whoa!
[崩溃]
哇！

06:52.904 --> 06:55.490
Hey! What's going on?
[thud]
嘿！这是怎么回事？
[砰]

06:55.559 --> 06:58.870
- [grunting]
[clanging]
- [咕哝]
[叮叮当当]

07:01.628 --> 07:02.973
- Hey, Squidward,
- 嘿，章鱼哥，

07:03.042 --> 07:04.628
get that hunk of junk
out of here, would you?
得到那一大堆垃圾
离开这里，你愿意吗？

07:04.697 --> 07:05.628
Come on.
快点。

07:05.697 --> 07:06.904
- Gladly.
- 很高兴。

07:08.594 --> 07:10.663
[crashing]
[崩溃]

07:10.732 --> 07:13.939
- Hello, anyone wanna
make a call?
- 你好，有人想要吗
打电话？

07:14.008 --> 07:16.145
Only costs a quarter.
只需要四分之一的费用。

07:16.214 --> 07:17.594
Ooh, barnacles!
哦，藤壶！

07:17.663 --> 07:19.249
[foghorn blares]
[bell dinging]
[雾号声]
[铃声]

07:19.318 --> 07:21.456
- Sometimes a free phone
- 有时有免费电话

07:21.525 --> 07:23.870
comes at a very high price,
价格非常高，

07:23.939 --> 07:26.180
and sometimes the cheapskates
有时还有小气鬼

07:26.249 --> 07:28.559
are the ones who get stuck
with the bill
是那些被困住的人
与账单

07:28.628 --> 07:30.559
here in "The Tidal Zone."
这里是“潮汐区”。

07:30.628 --> 07:33.387
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

07:33.456 --> 07:34.628
Hello?
你好？

07:34.697 --> 07:37.628
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:37.697 --> 07:42.973
Must give
away one more story.
必须给
还有一个故事。

07:43.042 --> 07:47.249
The story of a grandpa
adrift in space and time.
爷爷的故事
在空间和时间中漂泊。

07:47.318 --> 07:51.904
The story of a sea star who
is lost in "The Tidal Zone."
一个海星的故事
迷失在“潮汐区”。

07:51.973 --> 07:53.594
[dial tone blaring]
[拨号音刺耳]

07:53.663 --> 07:56.904
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

- [大喊]